# ===========================================================================
# Unity - standard generated folders
# ===========================================================================
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
*.csproj
*.sln
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
sysinfo.txt
LightingData.asset

# ===========================================================================
# Baked NavMesh data
#
# Derived data. Unity re-bakes these from the scene when the project opens, so
# they carry no source information - but they are 938 MB across only 5 files,
# and the largest single file is 314 MB. GitHub REJECTS any single file over
# 100 MB, so committing these makes the push fail outright.
# ===========================================================================
/Assets/Scenes/**/*.asset

# ===========================================================================
# Unity Asset Store art - NOT REDISTRIBUTABLE
#
# This is a public repository. These folders hold third-party art imported from
# the Unity Asset Store, whose licences forbid redistribution:
#   Asseset/, Asseset2/   terrains demo and flooded-grounds environment packs
#   Character/, Terrain/ character models and environment art
#   Casual_Hit/, OccaSoftware/
# Do not remove these lines to "make the project work" - re-import the art into
# your LOCAL copy from your own Asset Store library instead. Only your own
# scripts, settings, prefabs, scenes and Wwise definitions belong in git.
# ===========================================================================
/Assets/Asseset/
/Assets/Asseset2/
/Assets/Character/
/Assets/Terrain/
/Assets/Casual_Hit/
/Assets/OccaSoftware/

# ===========================================================================
# Wwise - keep the integration source, drop the native SDK
#
# Kept, because these prove the audio work in this project:
#   ScriptableObjects/      40 Events, 4 Switches, 2 SwitchGroups, 2 Soundbanks
#   API/Runtime/Generated/  generated SoundBanks C#
#   API/Runtime/Handwritten/, API/Editor/, MonoBehaviour/
#
# Dropped, because it is 1.36 GB of native binaries plus localised docs that no
# reviewer needs and that would bloat every clone:
#   API/Runtime/Plugins/    .dll / .a / .bundle for every platform
#   Documentation/           98 MB of localised HTML
#
# To run the project locally, re-import the integration from the Unity editor:
#   Audiokinetic Wwise > ProjectDatabase > Integrate Unity Project
# or re-run the Wwise Launcher. The version is pinned in
# Assets/Wwise/API/.../Version.txt (Wwise SDK 2024.1.6, build 8842).
# ===========================================================================
/Assets/Wwise/API/Runtime/Plugins/
/Assets/Wwise/ProjectDatabase/Runtime/Plugins/
/Assets/Wwise/Documentation/
